<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong Land names senior appointment.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Land names senior appointment.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong Land Ltd said on Monday it had appointed Duncan Straughen to its board as director for infrastructure investments.</p>
<p>Straughen, who was the group's treasurer, would be succeeded by Francis Heng.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
